00:03:00,965 --> 00:03:08,360
Chronicle of the Great Death in Wisborg

23
00:03:08,485 --> 00:03:15,880
anno Domini 1838 , by ...

24
00:03:16,005 --> 00:03:20,715
NOSFERATU

25
00:03:20,845 --> 00:03:28,843
Does this word not sound to you like the midnight cry of the Deathbird .

26
00:03:28,965 --> 00:03:34,562
Take care in saying it ,

27
00:03:34,685 --> 00:03:42,683
lest life 's images fade into shadows , and ghostly dreams rise from

28
00:03:42,805 --> 00:03:50,803
