29
00:03:50,845 --> 00:03:56,124
Long have I contemplated the origin and recession

30
00:03:56,245 --> 00:04:02,241
of the Great Death in my hometown of Wisborg .

31
00:04:02,365 --> 00:04:05,357
Here is it 's story :

32
00:04:05,485 --> 00:04:11,481
There lived in Wisborg Hutter and his young wife Ellen

33
00:05:46,245 --> 00:05:54,755
Why did you kill them ... the lovely flowers ? !

34
00:06:13,245 --> 00:06:21,084
Not so fast , my young friend ! No-one outruns his destiny .

35
00:06:29,525 --> 00:06:33,882
There was also a property agent by the name of Knock -

36
00:06:34,005 --> 00:06:37,156
the subject of all sorts of rumours .

37
00:06:37,285 --> 00:06:40,800
One thing was certain : He paid his people well

38
00:07:42,965 --> 00:07:47,993
Count Orlok - His Lordship ... from Transylvania ...

39
00:07:48,125 --> 00:07:53,643
wishes to acquire a beautiful home in our little town ...

40
00:07:55,845 --> 00:08:01,602
You could earn a nice bit of money

41
00:08:04,965 --> 00:08:11,359
of course the price is a little effort ... some sweat

42
00:08:11,485 --> 00:08:17,481
and perhaps ... a little blood ...

43
00:09:05,165 --> 00:09:09,078
He wants a fine , deserted house ...

44
00:09:21,365 --> 00:09:25,438
That house ... directly across from yours .

45
00:09:25,565 --> 00:09:27,635
Offer him that one !

46
00:09:29,965 --> 00:09:34,402
Travel quickly , travel well , my young friend ,

47
00:09:34,525 --> 00:09:38,916
into the land of the spectres .

48
00:09:56,965 --> 00:10:00,196
I 'm travelling far , far away

49
00:10:00,325 --> 00:10:04,841
into the land of thieves and spectres .

50
00:11:37,205 --> 00:11:46,876
So Hutter placed the anguished girl in the care of his friends ,

51
00:11:47,005 --> 00:11:56,801
the rich shipowner Harding and his sister

52
00:12:17,125 --> 00:12:19,195
Be at ease .

53
00:13:10,645 --> 00:13:14,558
And young Hutter travelled many dusty roads ,

54
00:13:14,685 --> 00:13:18,678
but at last the peaks of the Carpathlans

55
00:13:18,805 --> 00:13:22,593
loomed before him .

56
00:13:22,725 --> 00:13:27,116
The horses strained harder

57
00:14:34,125 --> 00:14:37,640
Quickly ... something to eat -

58
00:14:37,765 --> 00:14:41,474
I have to get to Count Orlok 's castle !

59
00:15:13,485 --> 00:15:20,800
You shouldn 't go any further now : The Werewolf roams the woods .

60
00:17:06,205 --> 00:17:11,404
Of Vampyres Gastlie Spirits , Bewitchments

61
00:17:11,525 --> 00:17:16,076
and the Seven Deadlie Sins

62
00:17:16,205 --> 00:17:22,075
From Belial 's seed sprang the vampyre NOSFERATU ,

63
00:17:22,205 --> 00:17:28,201
who doth live and feed on the bloode of humankind -

64
00:17:28,325 --> 00:17:34,321
Beyonde deliverance he doth dwell in gastlie caves ,

65
00:17:34,445 --> 00:17:40,441
sepulchres and coffins , filled so with god-curst earth

66
00:17:40,565 --> 00:17:46,561
from the fields of the Black Death

67
00:19:01,685 --> 00:19:04,995
Of Vampyres Gastlie Spirits , Bewitchments

68
00:19:05,125 --> 00:19:07,514
and the Seven Deadlie Sins

69
00:20:27,045 --> 00:20:29,115
Onward ! The sun is setting !

70
00:20:57,405 --> 00:21:06,962
Offer what you like ! We 're not going any further !

71
00:21:17,245 --> 00:21:25,596
We won 't go on ! I  s frightening beyond the pass !

72
00:21:53,125 --> 00:21:58,324
No sooner had Hutter stepped across the bridge ,

73
00:21:58,445 --> 00:22:04,998
than the eerle visions he had often told me about

74
00:22:05,125 --> 00:22:10,040
seized hold of him .

75
00:25:10,685 --> 00:25:16,555
You have kept me waiting - waiting too long . -

76
00:25:16,685 --> 00:25:22,601
Now it is nearly midnight . The servants are sleeping !

77
00:25:38,365 --> 00:25:40,321
End of the 1st Act .

78
00:25:41,125 --> 00:25:42,638
Nosferatu 2nd Act .

79
00:26:42,005 --> 00:26:46,476
You have hurt yourself ... Precious blood !

80
00:27:14,845 --> 00:27:22,081
Shouldn 't we like to sit together a bit , dear friend ?

81
00:27:22,205 --> 00:27:32,274
It is a while still till Sunrise - and in the daytime I sleep ,

82
00:27:32,405 --> 00:27:38,082
my dear fellow , I sleep the deepest of sleeps -

83
00:27:54,205 --> 00:27:58,881
Just as the sun rose ,

84
00:27:59,005 --> 00:28:03,920
