85
00:30:22,925 --> 00:30:27,157
My dear ! My dearest !

86
00:30:27,285 --> 00:30:33,804
Grieve not that thy beloved is so far away

87
00:30:43,205 --> 00:30:48,040
I am plagued by mosquitoes .

88
00:30:48,165 --> 00:30:54,001
I already have two bites on my throat ,

89
00:30:54,125 --> 00:30:59,836
one quite near the other , on each side

90
00:31:07,005 --> 00:31:13,956
One dreams so heavily in this desolate castle ,

91
00:31:14,085 --> 00:31:17,634
but fear not .

92
00:32:01,245 --> 00:32:07,684
The spectral evening light seemed to revive the shadows

93
00:32:07,805 --> 00:32:12,925
