94
00:32:49,845 --> 00:32:56,080
Your wife has a lovely neck ...

95
00:33:05,725 --> 00:33:09,161
I shall buy the house ...

96
00:33:09,285 --> 00:33:13,039
The fine , deserted house opposite yours ...

97
00:33:45,565 --> 00:33:50,559
At night this same Nosferatu doth clutch his victim

98
00:33:50,685 --> 00:33:57,158
and doth suck like hellish life-potion it 's blood .

99
00:34:02,005 --> 00:34:09,081
Take heede that his shadow not encumber thee

100
00:34:09,205 --> 00:34:14,233
like an incubus with gruesome dreams

101
00:35:29,685 --> 00:35:31,482
At the same hour .

102
00:36:32,205 --> 00:36:35,083
A doctor ... a doctor !

103
00:38:05,365 --> 00:38:07,720
Harmless congestions of the blood .

104
00:38:10,765 --> 00:38:14,758
The doctor related Ellen 's distress to me

105
00:38:14,885 --> 00:38:17,877
as an unknown Illness .

106
00:38:18,005 --> 00:38:21,600
I know , however , that her soul that night

107
00:38:21,725 --> 00:38:24,717
