108
00:38:24,845 --> 00:38:29,043
Nosferatu was already spreading his wings . -

109
00:38:29,165 --> 00:38:32,714
Yet with the morning light Hutter set out

110
00:38:32,845 --> 00:38:36,633
to make sense of the horror of his nights . -

111
00:42:07,965 --> 00:42:12,163
The raftsmen didn 't know what kind of unholy cargo

112
00:42:12,285 --> 00:42:16,073
they were conveying through the dale .

113
00:42:34,805 --> 00:42:36,523
End of the 2nd Act .

114
00:42:37,165 --> 00:42:38,393
Nosferatu 3rd Act .

115
00:42:51,005 --> 00:42:56,398
He was brought to the hospital yesterday by some farmers .

116
00:42:56,525 --> 00:43:01,838
They said he must have fallen . He 's still feverish ...

117
00:43:16,485 --> 00:43:17,884
Coffins -

118
00:43:25,285 --> 00:43:30,678
Nosferatu was on his way . The danger for Wisborg drew nigh .

119
00:43:30,805 --> 00:43:34,195
The Paracelslan Professor Bulwer ,

120
00:43:34,325 --> 00:43:38,716
