125
00:44:09,645 --> 00:44:15,356
The vessel 's still set for sail tonight .

126
00:44:25,685 --> 00:44:29,917
Bill of Lading : EMPUSA

127
00:44:30,045 --> 00:44:34,641
Route : From GALAZ to WISBORG

128
00:44:34,765 --> 00:44:40,954
Cargo : 6 crates of earth ( experimental purposes )

129
00:45:39,085 --> 00:45:48,357
In those days , I should note , Prof. Bulwer was explaining

130
00:45:48,485 --> 00:45:58,235
