131
00:45:58,365 --> 00:46:08,115
They observed in horror nature 's mysterious ways .

132
00:46:48,805 --> 00:46:53,720
Like a vampire - isn 't it ?

133
00:46:56,765 --> 00:47:01,361
It seems that the approach of the strangler , Nosferatu ,

134
00:47:01,485 --> 00:47:05,603
already compelled the property agent Knock

135
00:47:05,725 --> 00:47:08,478
into his shadow .

136
00:47:16,805 --> 00:47:24,564
The patient admitted yesterday is going mad ...

137
00:47:55,525 --> 00:48:00,315
Blood is life ! Blood is life !

138
00:48:34,805 --> 00:48:37,797
And this one here

139
00:48:41,245 --> 00:48:47,195
a polyp with tentacles

140
00:48:56,085 --> 00:49:01,159
