141
00:49:08,805 --> 00:49:14,163
almost but a phantom ...

142
00:49:22,765 --> 00:49:25,962
Spiders !

143
00:49:56,405 --> 00:49:59,715
Ellen was often seen on the beach

144
00:49:59,845 --> 00:50:03,440
within the solitude of the dunes .

145
00:50:03,565 --> 00:50:06,363
Yearning for her beloved ,

146
00:50:06,485 --> 00:50:10,637
her eyes scanned waves and distance alike .

147
00:52:00,125 --> 00:52:04,960
My dear ! My dearest !

148
00:52:05,085 --> 00:52:10,876
Grieve not that thy beloved is so far away

149
00:52:15,485 --> 00:52:18,204
I am plagued by mosquitoes .

150
00:52:18,325 --> 00:52:22,284
I already have two bites on my throat ,

151
00:52:22,405 --> 00:52:27,035
one quite near the other , on each side

152
00:52:30,085 --> 00:52:32,280
One dreams so heavily in this desolate castle ,

153
00:52:32,405 --> 00:52:33,997
but fear not .

154
00:53:05,685 --> 00:53:13,717
No I must go ... by the shortest route home !

155
00:54:48,205 --> 00:54:52,437
PLAGUE . A plague epidemic has broken out

156
00:54:52,565 --> 00:54:57,081
in Transylvania and the Black Sea ports

157
00:54:57,205 --> 00:55:02,563
