186
01:09:11,685 --> 01:09:15,473
Thank God ... you 're safe ... All 's well now ...

187
01:10:53,525 --> 01:11:02,194
Looked over everything ... Not a living soul on board .

188
01:11:58,805 --> 01:12:01,194
Varna - 12 July

189
01:12:01,325 --> 01:12:05,318
Crew - minus myself as captain : One helmsman , :

190
01:12:05,445 --> 01:12:08,835
One ship 's mate , : Five sailors

191
01:13:12,365 --> 01:13:17,598
Second day - 13 July one sailor ill with fever

192
01:13:17,725 --> 01:13:21,877
Course : SSW Wind : NE

193
01:13:22,005 --> 01:13:28,240
Third day - 14 July ship 's mate is babbling

194
01:13:28,365 --> 01:13:33,439
claims strange passenger is below deck

195
01:13:33,565 --> 01:13:39,276
Course : SE Wind : NE

196
01:13:46,085 --> 01:13:51,762
Tenth day - 22 July

197
01:13:51,885 --> 01:13:58,438
rats in ship 's hold danger of plague

198
01:14:05,085 --> 01:14:08,316
Danger of plague ! Go home !

199
01:14:08,445 --> 01:14:11,835
Shut all windows and doors !

200
01:15:00,165 --> 01:15:03,714
PROCLAMATION

201
01:15:03,845 --> 01:15:08,441
It is hereby decreed that the honourable magistrate

202
01:15:08,565 --> 01:15:12,843
