209
01:17:12,965 --> 01:17:20,724
Yet she could not resist it 's bizarre attraction .

210
01:17:23,045 --> 01:17:27,004
At night this same Nosferatu doth clutch his victim

211
01:17:27,125 --> 01:17:31,164
and doth suck like hellish life-potion it 's blood .

212
01:17:47,965 --> 01:17:55,599
Take heede that his shadow not encumber thee

213
01:17:55,725 --> 01:18:01,402
like an incubus with gruesome dreams

214
01:18:01,525 --> 01:18:07,919
Wherefore no other salvation is possible ,

215
01:18:08,045 --> 01:18:15,042
