217
01:18:22,285 --> 01:18:29,282
Would that she give freely of her blood

218
01:18:53,805 --> 01:18:59,675
This is what I see - each evening !

219
01:20:14,765 --> 01:20:20,954
Fear lurked in every corner of the town .

220
01:20:21,085 --> 01:20:25,044
Who was still well ? Who already ill ?

221
01:20:35,645 --> 01:20:41,322
I 'll run over there quickly ... I 'll fetch Sievers ...

222
01:21:50,365 --> 01:21:56,998
Wherefore no other salvation is possible ,

223
01:21:57,125 --> 01:22:04,236
but that a maiden wholly without sin

224
01:22:04,365 --> 01:22:10,884
maketh the Vampyre forget the first crow of the cock .

225
01:22:11,005 --> 01:22:18,036
Would that she give freely of her blood

226
01:22:26,325 --> 01:22:30,796
The panic-stricken town was looking for a victim :

227
01:22:30,925 --> 01:22:34,201
It was Knock .

228
01:22:43,405 --> 01:22:47,478
Someone saw him ! He ran outside !

229
01:22:47,605 --> 01:22:51,041
He strangled the custodian ...

230
01:22:59,525 --> 01:23:03,564
He strangled him ... the vampire !

231
01:24:11,645 --> 01:24:15,320
I LOVE YOU

232
01:27:49,605 --> 01:27:52,165
